        <shicang:rhymeChars xml:lang="zh">交巾人干频春</shicang:rhymeChars>
        <shicang:workFirstLine xml:lang="zh">东野亡来无丽句</shicang:workFirstLine>
        <shicang:workFullText xml:lang="zh">东野亡来无丽句于君去后少交亲追思往事好沾巾白头王建在犹见咏诗人学道深山空自老留名千载不干身酒筵歌席莫辞频争如南陌上占取一年春</shicang:workFullText>
        <shicang:sourceBook xml:lang="zh">全宋词</shicang:sourceBook>
