        <shicang:rhymeChars xml:lang="zh">来徊流休</shicang:rhymeChars>
        <shicang:workFirstLine xml:lang="zh">东皇也合怜芳草</shicang:workFirstLine>
        <shicang:workFullText xml:lang="zh">东皇也合怜芳草不雨春先老鵾弦才拨带愁来却似当年佳月共徘徊隋堤弱絮年年舞谩惜今和古长江凄咽为谁流难道雨花春色片时休</shicang:workFullText>
        <shicang:sourceBook xml:lang="zh">拙政园诗余</shicang:sourceBook>
